[TITLE]
Anahita demonstration network placed in Tabriz (WGS 84 / UTM zone 38N, EPSG:32638)
Looped 3 x 3 grid fed by a pumped reservoir, with an elevated storage tank

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID              Elev            Demand          Pattern
 J1              20              0               PAT1
 J2              18              5               PAT1
 J3              16              5               PAT1
 J4              18              5               PAT1
